  "selection": "Pinned project source and required data maps and compiled artwork. Omitted labs, generated docs and OS/VCS/build metadata.",
  "controlsRationale": "Menu starts at guest0,0, use relative swipe+576,+230 then Select/Fire. WASD left pad moves and strafes; right mouse stick turns, Q holds original inventory, key2 selects pistol, Shift sprints, Escape returns. Actual source level1 route W450 A800 W100 A500 W150, Pistol2, W500 picks armor20 and pistol ammo, original reload yields11 rounds; two normal fire presses decrease to9. Right-look rotation and both landscape/portrait overlay inspected. Multiplayer and complete campaign unverified.",
